# Ports happy-svc-ctl publishes from the happy-svc daemon's network namespace to the host,
# always on 127.0.0.1 (the wrapper has no way to name another address). One port or a range
# of at most 64 per line, 1024-65535, then an optional word. Host clients that use them:
# vault-mcp, the bridge's stdio MCP, Caddy, agentgateway, the Happy workspace proxy.
8222        vaultwarden
6091        filler
6090        bridge
8010        controller
6080        novnc
8100-8131   pod-controllers
6100-6131   pod-novnc
